": "Screenshot 2026-04-22 183050.png", "id": "1867008377351259", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1867008380684592_6880396884020025782_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PJLMvAu-CKAQ7kNvwEOpbah&_nc_oc=AdqjTvzcLzdQBPdvQAaD5hvJE05YwCtsAwSseaCHSaLkOAzSf9pYSCJupSVB6u1zSyw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af96G5tgnoJR-PyJfrgvbjzTQ_JXleC87yWXXE2TT9Vo3Q&oe=6A216F90"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 2026-04-22 182950.png", "id": "1497513168406732", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618064_1497513171740065_7327587827834032018_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JqJYUtoCe2IQ7kNvwHzrBvi&_nc_oc=Adppy6cPjAXtG16ZhzW80VgJuMDm8Ji4PqFYs9HywnIZZ6aKfmFVhsSlIK3OT6499Uw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9ljMMCeRA9g9kf6IzQ60YzWt9XGgPBQBa-x3wRUfwJqw&oe=6A218839"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 2026-04-22 183002.png", "id": "1332393342127564", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618938_1332393345460897_8992074743206624923_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6LhiYfqqr8QQ7kNvwE1QqTY&_nc_oc=AdrB-0eCNpMwbjuP6MW7MOVV1L8eD5I2IdGq_VVaFtPbgIlx7DyT7JZVa7ywnLCpE84&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8WEWMsrcEPaIufmTfTs7fkDNCHMy2Frx-WoltJbgMsSA&oe=6A219F23"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 2026-04-22 182937.png", "id": "26822660627371867", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619145_26822660650705198_178178829357942133_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yMFAvbs_ikIQ7kNvwH57FoV&_nc_oc=AdretL8x_pgeJoq3H3bqZ3-nLK5R5WAT18D1gl42C99J5UCNTW2DZCsPxGamU9blpi0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_6DWEeYjgVgs6LZ2kl1oXC4RT7-OytrVrctMGbwxub8A&oe=6A217384"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Controls and Wiring", "keywords": ["control", "wiring", "vr", "immerselearn"], "long_description": "Controls and Wiring is an immersive VR training application that enables learners to develop real-world skills in electrical control systems, circuit wiring, and component integration. Through interactive simulations, users practice identifying components, interpreting wiring diagrams, assembling control circuits, and troubleshooting faults in a safe, virtual environment.\n\nThis application is a core component of the Immerse Learn Controls and Wiring micro-credential program, designed to enhance technical proficiency through experiential learning. Learners gain confidence by performing tasks that mirror real industry scenarios, improving both accuracy and decision-making skills.\n\nPlease note: This app is not a standalone product. Access is strictly limited to individuals enrolled in the Immerse Learn Controls and Wiring micro-credential program, where it is used for guided, hands-on training.", "short_description": "Controls and Wiring is a VR training application designed to build practical skills in electrical control systems and wiring. Part of the Immerse Learn Controls and Wiring micro-credential program, this app provides hands-on, immersive learning experiences. Access is exclusively available to learners enrolled in the program."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://immerselearn.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ImmerseLearn", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://immerselearn.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_in